# The 2D `grid` dialect (Befunge-flavored).
#
# The instruction pointer starts top-left moving right. `"` enters string mode,
# pushing each character's code until the next `"`. The string is written
# REVERSED so that popping it with `,` prints in the right order. `@` stops.
{grid
>"!dlroW ,olleH",,,,,,,,,,,,,@
}
